        "1": {
            "ID": "812566",
            "URL": "https://thetvdb.com/series/bhxh/seasons/official/1",
            "Titles": {
                "eng": null,
                "jpn": null,
                "zho": null
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "In the early days of the Sirius War, Feng Yin, a newcomer to the battlefield, proved his worth as a new generation of super warriors on the front line through several heroic battles. However, when he was following his superiors, he was attacked by the Gokai Black Army. , was forced to retreat. The base at the rear was cold, but Feng Yin found a familiar figure. The comrade-in-arms in the previous battle was just an ordinary human. He thought he died in a sneak attack by the Black Army, but found that he was unscathed. He greeted him in the past, but the other party ignored his love. Feng Yin suspected that this person had colluded with the black army, so he secretly investigated and found that his life experience was very mysterious, and he only knew that he called himself Wang Ye.",
                "jpn": null,
                "zho": "天狼星战争初期，战场新人风吟通过几次英勇作战，在前线证明了自己作为新生代超级战士的价值，然而就在跟随上级长官高歌猛进时，却被歌凯黑军偷袭，长官战死，战地失守，被迫后退。后方基地一片冷淡，风吟却发现一个熟悉的身影，先前战斗中的战友，只是普通人类，还以为死在了黑军偷袭中，却发现他毫发无损。过去问候，对方却对其爱答不理，风吟怀疑此人与黑军有勾结，便暗中调查，发现他的身世非常神秘，只知道自称王野。"
            },
